delivery_started_at.description:
When the irreversible SMTP DATA phase began (H6 double-send fence).
`None` = delivery not yet started, so crash recovery may safely re-queue;
`Some` = the MX may have accepted, so recovery must not auto-resend.

tracking.description:
Per-email tracking override. When `false`, disables open/click tracking
for this email even if the account has tracking enabled. When `true`,
enables tracking even if the account default is off. Omit to use account default.
